# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# SPA fallback (the old vercel.json rewrite of /(.*) to /index.html): Cloudflare
# Pages does this natively. The build has no top-level 404.html, so any path that
# is not a real file (for example /cod) is served index.html with status 200 and
# React Router takes over. A "/* /index.html 200" rule is not needed here; Pages
# rejects it as an infinite loop.
#
